    "title": "50 Cent Leaks Disturbing New Footage of Diddy in Prison | Chaos Inside",
    "text": "50 Cent Leaks Disturbing New Footage of Diddy in Prison | Chaos InsideNew footage allegedly leaked by 50 Cent is going viral, showing Diddy looking shaken behind bars—contradicting long-standing rumors that he was living comfortably in prison. As speculation grows, insiders claim rising tension and unresolved grudges tied to Tupac Shakur and The Notorious B.I.G. may still be following him decades later. This video dives deep into the history behind the East Coast–West Coast feud, the unsolved shootings of Tupac and Biggie, and why Diddy’s name has continued to surface in conversations surrounding both cases. We break down claims made in the Netflix docuseries Shawn Combs: The Reckoning, statements from former associates, and recent legal developments that have reignited public debate. ⚠️ Disclaimer: This video discusses allegations, public statements, and documented reports. Diddy has denied all accusations and has never been charged in connection with the murders of Tupac Shakur or The Notorious B.I.G. Do you think the truth will ever fully come out? Will we ever see justice for Tupac and Biggie? 👇 Share your thoughts in the comments.",
